---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this blog and the author.">
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert mt-8">
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
      <img
        src="/images/fotoprofilo.jpg"
        alt="Author profile picture"
        class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700"
      />
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-center text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">About</h1>
    <p>This is a personal technical blog focused on software architecture, distributed systems, and database internals.</p>
    <p>I write about patterns and practices that help teams build resilient, maintainable, and performant systems. My goal is to make complex topics accessible through clear explanations, practical examples, and real-world trade-offs.</p>
    <p>You can find me on:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/andre" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://twitter.com/andre" target="_blank">Twitter</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
